## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `grok-4.6` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Grok 4.6 (High) as a deprecated proprietary reasoning model (released 2026-08-12) with 500k context window, text+image input, text output, and pricing around $2.00/$6.00 per 1M tokens in the fetched snapshot. xAI developer docs list `grok-4.6` with 500k context and tiered pricing ($2/$6 under 200k prompt tokens, $4/$12 at/above 200k). OpenRouter lists `x-ai/grok-4.6` with provider routing/pricing.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

